# Butler Routes - Stormwind City completionist (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Every Stormwind City quest in the local census (190 quests,
# docs/stormwind-census.md) appears exactly once as an accept and once as a
# turnin. Stormwind is a hub the character returns to across their whole
# leveling life, so the route is ordered for repeated use: grouped by district
# with chains kept together, then accept-based expeditions by destination zone.
# Quest levels run 1-60 (min-levels 1-60); high-level legs carry notes saying
# which level they belong to. One special: 1716 shows level -1 (the warlock
# infernal ritual, gated min 20). Coordinates in Stormwind use the era frame;
# expedition stops use the frames their data carries, set with zone map lines.
guide butler-routes-completionist/stormwind-city
title Stormwind City - Completionist
levels 1-60
zone Stormwind City
faction Alliance
category Leveling
folder Cities
keywords stormwind, city, completionist
coords live
version 1

step Stormwind Harbor — arrival

  note Stormwind is a hub for the whole leveling life: land at the harbor, and set your hearth at Innkeeper Allison in the Trade District when you pass her.
  note Quests here span level 1 to 60 — the steps say which legs belong to which level; low-level arrivals do the early steps and come back for the rest.
  accept 97220 -- Philmor's Favor - Manifest Clerk Philmor; Elaine Trias waits up the hill
  goto 26.12,47.06
  accept 95065 optional -- Fishin' Time - Gilbert Gray; shiny baubles and nightcrawlers, whatever the water gives
  turnin 97220 -- Philmor's Favor - Philmor's word to Elaine Trias
  accept 97222 -- Gatehouse Goods - Elaine Trias; the Gatehouse Door just up the road
  complete 97222 @66.48,74.8 era -- the Gatehouse Door
  turnin 97222 -- Gatehouse Goods - back to Elaine Trias
  complete 95065 @26.12,47.06 era -- Shiny Baubles and Nightcrawlers for Gilbert Gray optional
  turnin 95065 optional -- Fishin' Time - back to Gilbert Gray

